FROM command-r7b-arabic

# ── Speed settings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep model layers in VRAM between requests (don't unload after each question)
PARAMETER num_keep 24

# Context window: 4096 so the grounding passage + instructions never get truncated.
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096

# Max tokens per response. Questions don't need more than this.
PARAMETER num_predict 600

# Push all layers to GPU. 99 means "as many as fit".
PARAMETER num_gpu 99

# ── Quality settings ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Low temperature keeps the question tied to the source passage (less drift/invention)
PARAMETER temperature 0.4

# Penalise repeating the same phrases
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1

# ── SmartSchool system prompt baked into the model ─────────────────────────────
SYSTEM """You are SmartSchool AI — an expert Arabic and English educator specialized in generating high-quality exam questions strictly from school textbook content.

Your rules:
1. ALWAYS respond with valid JSON only — no markdown, no extra text, no code fences.
2. ALL JSON keys must be in English (question, options, correct_answer, explanation, model_answer, key_points, type, bloom_level, difficulty).
3. Question content (text, answers, explanations) must be in the language requested.
4. NEVER invent information not present in the reference text.
5. ALWAYS follow the exact JSON format shown in each request."""
